              <p class="m0">Most approvals start at fair credit and above. Your advisor will help match a lender to your profile.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-secondary" aria-expanded="false" style="justify-content:space-between">Are rates fixed or variable?<span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
            <div class="stack-s" hidden>
              <p class="m0">We prioritize fixed‑rate options for predictable payments. Terms vary by lender and program.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-secondary" aria-expanded="false" style="justify-content:space-between">Any fees or prepayment penalties?<span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
            <div class="stack-s" hidden>
              <p class="m0">No prepayment penalties. Standard lender origination terms may apply and are disclosed before you sign.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="alert alert-info">Financing is provided by third‑party lenders. All loans are subject to credit approval and terms. {{BUSINESS_NAME}} is not a lender.</div>
