  <main id="main">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container stack-l">
        <div class="stack-s center">
          <span class="badge">5‑Star Reputation</span>
          <h1 class="m0">Stories from our customers</h1>
          <p class="m0" style="color:var(--muted)">We’re proud to serve {{CITY}} with honesty and care. Here’s what people say.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">AC Repair • Same Day</strong><p class="m0">“Tech had the part on the truck. Entire visit took 45 minutes and our home was cooling by dinner.”</p><span class="help">— Lindsay P.</span></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">Furnace Replacement</strong><p class="m0">“Immaculate install and the crew vacuumed when done. Utility bill dropped right away.”</p><span class="help">— Marco D.</span></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">Maintenance Plan</strong><p class="m0">“They caught a failing capacitor during tune‑up and saved us a summer breakdown.”</p><span class="help">— Renee C.</span></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">Indoor Air Quality</strong><p class="m0">“Allergy symptoms are way down. The UV and filter combo made a difference.”</p><span class="help">— Patel Family</span></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">Heat Pump Install</strong><p class="m0">“Qualified us for rebates and explained every setting. Quietest system we’ve owned.”</p><span class="help">— Greg & Mei</span></blockquote>
          <blockquote class="card stack-s"><strong class="m0">Emergency Call</strong><p class="m0">“They answered at 1am, walked me through shutting off the unit, and arrived first thing.”</p><span class="help">— Ron S.</span></blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="card stack-m">
          <h2 class="m0">Leave a review</h2>
          <p>We’d love your feedback. Share your experience to help neighbors choose with confidence.</p>
          <form class="form" data-enhanced>
            <div class="input"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
            <div class="input"><label for="service">Service</label><select id="service" name="service" required><option value="">Select a service</option><option>AC Repair</option><option>Heating Repair</option><option>Installation</option><option>Maintenance</option><option>IAQ</option></select></div>
            <div class="input"><label for="message">Review</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" required></textarea></div>
            <div class="stack-s"><div class="help">By submitting, you agree to let us display your review on our website. We may edit for clarity and length.</div><div class="alert alert-info" data-form-alert role="status">Your review helps our local community. Thank you!</div></div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Submit review</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="container cta-band">
        <div><h3 class="m0">Need service now?</h3><p class="m0">We’re ready to help—today.</p></div>
        <div><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:{{PHONE}}" data-dial>Call {{PHONE}}</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="book.html">Book online</a></div>
      </div>
